"releaseNotes":"This update adds a private document vault for Plus Care Circles, more app languages, clearer unread Family Chat notices, and reliability improvements across care and onboarding.", "releaseDate":"2026-09-09T07:00:00Z", "minimumOsVersion":"16.4", "sellerName":"Ribek Maharjan", "primaryGenreName":"Health & Fitness", "primaryGenreId":6013, "genreIds":["6013", "6012"], "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-10-21T16:32:20Z", "version":"1.0.6", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Coordinate care for an aging parent, partner, or loved one in one private place.\n\nAlongside is a family caregiver organizer for medications, tasks, appointments, notes, and handoffs. Invite relatives, neighbors, or trusted caregivers into a private Care Circle so everyone can work from the same current plan.\n\nKNOW WHAT MATTERS TODAY\n\nOpen Alongside to see what needs attention, what is due soon, who is responsible, and what has already been handled. Missed, overdue, changed, and unassigned care stays visible until the family addresses it.\n\nCOORDINATE MEDICATIONS\n\nCreate medication schedules and reminders, assign responsibility, and record doses as taken, skipped, or missed. Each confirmed action includes who recorded it and when, giving the Care Circle a shared medication history.\n\nSHARE TASKS AND APPOINTMENTS\n\nCreate one-time or recurring caregiver tasks, assign them or leave them open for someone to claim, and track completion. Keep appointments, preparation details, responsible people, outcomes, and follow-up items together.\n\nSEE WHAT HAPPENED\n\nAlongside automatically builds a timeline from care activity. Members can add observations and contextual comments, while important changes remain connected to the relevant care item.\n\nSTART THE NEXT HANDOFF INFORMED\n\nReview a structured briefing of unresolved items, important changes, missed or skipped care, observations, completed work, and what comes next. Open the underlying activity whenever more detail is needed.\n\nPRIVATE CARE CIRCLES\n\nOnly invited members can access a Care Circle. Organizer, caregiver, and viewer roles control what each person can do. Organizers can remove access, export Circle data, and request deletion.\n\nBUILT FOR REAL CARE DAYS\n\nRealtime updates help members see changes from other devices. Clear offline and pending-sync states show when an action still needs server confirmation. Notification preferences and quiet hours help each member control routine alerts.\n\nSTART FREE, EXPAND WITH PLUS\n\nFree includes one Care Circle, one recipient, and up to three active people, including the organizer. Core care coordination, history, notifications, and offline support remain available on Free. Plus expands capacity to three owned Care Circles, three recipients per Circle, and ten active people per Circle.\n\nAlongside is a family care-coordination tool. It is not a healthcare provider, pharmacy, emergency service, medical device, diagnostic tool, or substitute for professional medical advice. Confirm medications, doses, interactions, and care instructions with a qualified professional. Notifications can be delayed or not delivered. Contact local emergency services for urgent help.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://alongsidefamily.com/privacy\nTerms of Service: https://alongsidefamily.com/terms", "trackCensoredName":"Alongside: Family Care", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/alongside-family-care/id6803031055?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":0, "sellerUrl":"https://alongsidefamily.com", "languageCodesISO2A":["NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "HI", "ID", "IT", "JA", "KO", "PL", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "SV", "TH", "ZH", "TR", "UK", "VI"], "fileSizeBytes":"65591296", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"4+", "bundleId":"com.soman.alongside", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "userRatingCount":0}, 
